<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Washington returns six months after intake. Three weeks ago the prosthodontist connected stud attachments to the two implants and picked them up into the lower denture, which now clicks into place; he saw the prosthodontist again four days later for a planned check, and no adjustment was needed. He rates his chewing 8 out of 10 and eats a full diet, including meat and raw fruit; he stopped the nutritional supplement two weeks ago. He has given several speeches without the lower denture moving and no longer worries about it at dinners. He cleans the dentures and the attachments daily and keeps the dentures out overnight. His cough has gone and he is back to full days. His weight is 94.8 kg. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Overdenture</td><td>Attachments connected three weeks ago; check at four days without adjustment</td></tr><tr><td>Chewing</td><td>8 of 10; full diet</td></tr><tr><td>Speech</td><td>Speeches given without the denture moving</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>94.8 kg, up 2.4 kg from intake</td></tr><tr><td>Nutrition screen</td><td>MNA-SF 12 of 14; albumin 4.1 g/dL</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

