    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy back to normal</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No sore spots or bleeding around the implants</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cough gone</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Eating a full diet without difficulty</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
